- U | read every clause three times, and ask the mages what each one binds | grants: knowing the rules of the house | identity | habit | v: self-direction, security | chance: 90
- B | swear it with a reservation held silent in your mind | mark: hid a wrong | closed: approval: an oath of office sworn in bad faith; backfire: the oath bites, and its mark shows on the oath-taker's hands for all to see | v: power, self-direction | self_control: - | chance: 85
- R | refuse to swear, and give up the offices that need the oath | drops: minister; mayor; head of government | identity | mark: turned down a chance | v: self-direction | chance: 90
